    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC IAS / IFS Pre Answer Key 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-27T14:28:03+05:30\"\u003eMay 27, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e2:28 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eUnion Public Service Commission UPSC\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Pre Answer Key\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the Recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eCivil Services and Forest Service IAS / IFS \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExamination 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. The exam was conducted on \u003cstrong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"337\"\u003e24 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"370\"\u003eUPSC application process\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;started on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"402\"\u003e04 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"481\"\u003e27 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ePre Answer Key\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;using their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"586\"\u003eApplication Number, Password, or Security Pin\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by logging into the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eportal.\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003edirect link\u003c/strong\u003e is provided below. \u003cstrong\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003eAdvt. No. 05/2026\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC IAS / IFS Pre Answer Key 2026 – Out\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Civil Services IAS/IFS Examination 2026 : Short Details \u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsc-civil-services-ias-ifs-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e04 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e27 February 2026 (Extended)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cstrong\u003e27 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003ePre Exam Date :\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e 24 May 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e15 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e27 May 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeneral, OBC, EWS\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 100/-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSC / ST\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 0/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePH Candidates : ₹ 0/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll Female Category : ₹ 0/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Civil Services IAS/IFS Notification 2026 : Age Limit As On 01 August 2026\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e21 Years.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e32 Years.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMust have been born not earlier than\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2nd August, 1994\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and not later than\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e1st August, 2005\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAge Relaxation Extra as per \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Examination 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e933 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Civil Services IAS/IFS Pre Recruitment 2026 :\u0026nbsp;Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 75px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIndian Administrative Services (IAS)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\" rowspan=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e933 Posts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIndian Forest Services (IFS)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;UPSC Civil Services \u0026amp; Indian Forest Recruitment 2026 : \u003c/span\u003eEligibility Criteria\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndian Administrative Service (IAS)\u003c/strong\u003e: Candidates with a bachelor’s degree in any discipline from a recognized university in India are eligible for this examination.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndian Forest Service (IFS)\u003c/strong\u003e: Candidates with a bachelor’s degree in subjects like Animal Husbandry, Veterinary Science, Botany, Chemistry, Geology, Mathematics, Physics, Statistics, Zoology, Agriculture, or equivalent qualifications can apply.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor more details read the official notification before applying.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download UPSC Civil Services IAS/IFS Pre Answer Key 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"121xyo3\" data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"165\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the official website of the \u003cstrong data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"163\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eUnion Public Service Commission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e (UPSC)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1i3ftks\" data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"221\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eGo to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"195\"\u003e“Admit Cards”\u003c/strong\u003e section on the homepage\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1wgbpod\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"300\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on \u003cstrong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"293\"\u003e“Civil Services (IAS) / IFS Preliminary Answer Key 2026”\u003c/strong\u003e link\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"8uaquj\" data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"427\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eChoose any one option to download the admit card:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"427\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"eu2etr\" data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"406\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBy Registration ID\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"2dnfhp\" data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"427\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBy Roll Number\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1as2ika\" data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"526\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eEnter your details:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"526\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1xgcxlx\" 